OL,3,GNEWSAThe corner of Canada with the     
OL,4,AIrish accent                           
OL,6,FWatch 10 minutes of Netflix's horror   
OL,7,Fmini-series Below and you'll likely be 
OL,8,Fasking yourself: 'Why are they talking 
OL,9,Fwith Irish accents when it's in        
OL,10,FCanada?'                               
OL,12,FThe series is set in a remote coastal  
OL,13,Ffishing town in Newfoundland, Canada's 
OL,14,Fmost easterly province.                
OL,16,FIt follows fisherman Calvin Penney,    
OL,17,Fplayed by Josh Hartnett, as a          
OL,18,Fmysterious sea creature begins         
OL,19,Fterrorising the community.             
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
