OL,3,GNEWSAThe corner of Canada with the     
OL,4,AIrish accent                           
OL,6,FAnd while the main characters' "Irish" 
OL,7,Faccents may seem out of place,         
OL,8,FNewfoundland has always been a place   
OL,9,Fapart from the rest of Canada.         
